  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-15T04:13:22.866022Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-15T04:25:14.990728Z",
  "totalBlocks": 36,
  "translatedBlocks": 36,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8868b33dc9a70066",
      "translationZh": "今天，我们很高兴地宣布，Hugging Face 与 Amazon SageMaker AI 实现了深度链接集成。现在，开发者只需选择一次，就能从发现模型直接进入 SageMaker Studio 开展动手实验。无论是微调 Amazon SageMaker JumpStart 中的基础模型（FM），还是将其部署到 Amazon SageMaker Inference 端点，现在都可以直接进入相应的 SageMaker Studio 工作流。您选择的模型会预先加载，环境也已完成全部配置，随时可以开始使用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e9824f7a2f3ff255",
      "translationZh": "此前，在 Hugging Face 上发现模型后，要开始使用 SageMaker Studio，需要完成多个步骤，包括在 AWS Console 中打开 Amazon SageMaker AI、创建域、配置 IAM 权限，有时还需要申请 GPU 配额。对于希望快速迭代的开发者来说，这些阻碍拖慢了从灵感到实验的进程。此次集成让从发现模型到企业级部署的路径更加直接。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "45d20f6e20ee080a",
      "translationZh": "“在 Arcee，我们构建开放模型，让开发者和企业能够真正拥有自己运行的模型：检查权重、使用自己的数据进行后训练，并按自己的方式部署。此次集成让这一承诺走完了最后一公里。只需单击一次，就能从 Hugging Face 上的开放模型直接进入 SageMaker Studio，然后在自己的 AWS 环境中进行微调或部署，无须进行任何衔接配置——这正是开放模型一直缺少的体验。拥有自己的开放权重，在自己掌控的云中运行。这恰恰是我们的客户一直期盼的组合。”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0df32c71c230412e",
      "translationZh": "—— Mark McQuade，Arcee AI 创始人兼首席执行官",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9ccb2fa3463c5c0a",
      "translationZh": "随着一键直达 Studio 体验的推出，在受支持的 Hugging Face 模型页面上选择“Customize on SageMaker AI”或“Deploy on SageMaker AI”，即可直接进入控制台。随后，SageMaker AI 会在几秒钟内自动预置一个已预先配置权限的新域，并将模型上下文一并传递过去。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "37e6112e84a88385",
      "translationZh": "新增功能",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "be46b9aced1e7612",
      "translationZh": "此次发布引入了三项功能，缩短了从 Hugging Face 模型到可用的 SageMaker Studio 工作流之间的路径。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "161c4460c0b02fd6",
      "translationZh": "从 Hugging Face 直达 SageMaker Studio 的深度链接",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0dc32e1892066cad",
      "translationZh": "现在，当你在 Hugging Face 上浏览模型时，会在受支持的模型旁看到可直接衔接 SageMaker Studio 工作流的操作按钮：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "10b3d3fcbf5327fc",
      "translationZh": "“在 SageMaker AI 上定制”会打开 Studio 中的模型定制页面，并预先加载所选模型，以便进行微调。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "698bf97838b17c94",
      "translationZh": "“在 SageMaker AI 上部署”会打开 Studio 中的部署页面，并为模型预先配置好端点部署所需的设置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4eb9c52bf2de78a7",
      "translationZh": "每个入口都会保留上下文，这意味着进入 Studio 后，你无需再次搜索该模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "05b91f1bd1cd6e6d",
      "translationZh": "预配置的权限",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0b9dc2e99079a157",
      "translationZh": "通过此流程创建的新 Studio 环境已配置好使用 SageMaker AI 全部功能所需的权限，包括模型定制、训练作业、笔记本实验和端点部署。系统会为你创建并附加一个新的托管策略 AmazonSageMakerModelCustomizationCoreAccess。该策略提供运行无服务器模型定制作业所需的权限，支持使用监督微调（SFT）、直接偏好优化（DPO）、可验证奖励强化学习（RLVR）和 AI 反馈强化学习（RLAIF），并支持部署到 SageMaker AI 或 Amazon Bedrock 端点。这减轻了你在开始实验前手动创建和配置 AWS Identity and Access Management（IAM）角色及策略的负担。对于现有的 Studio 环境，系统会通过附有文档直达链接的可操作提示，指导你添加这些权限。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e4c532ae6e8f6df1",
      "translationZh": "GPU 配额可见性",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b93ee0b434324ceb",
      "translationZh": "现在，为部署或训练选择实例类型时，Studio 界面会直接在实例选择列表中显示配额可用情况。你可以立即看到，在账户当前限额下，哪些 GPU 实例类型（G5、G6）可用，无需单独前往 Service Quotas。如果仍需申请提高限额，系统会将你直接引导至相应实例类型的 Service Quotas 页面。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ccea0b77be4f2170",
      "translationZh": "操作演示：通过深层链接从 Hugging Face 跳转到 SageMaker Studio",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f9592b963f489d9d",
      "translationZh": "让我们一起了解从 Hugging Face 开始定制或部署模型的操作流程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ea4405785e1df657",
      "translationZh": "步骤 1：发现并选择",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c2130e45371112b6",
      "translationZh": "在 Hugging Face 模型页面上，点击“部署”，然后选择“Amazon SageMaker AI”。如果该模型受支持，你会看到两个按钮：“在 SageMaker AI 上部署”和“在 SageMaker AI 上定制”。然后，为受支持的模型选择“在 SageMaker AI 上定制”。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f72db258921c7941",
      "translationZh": "步骤 2：登录",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bfe6a8b4ddaf1bc9",
      "translationZh": "系统会提示你使用现有凭证登录 AWS。如果你已有处于活动状态的控制台会话，系统会自动跳过此步骤。有关更多信息，请参阅《登录 AWS 管理控制台》。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5d65f06672d1ef51",
      "translationZh": "步骤 3：进入 Studio",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e4e4ac13b2d66756",
      "translationZh": "你将直接进入 SageMaker Studio 中的模型定制页面，且你的模型已被预先选中。接下来，配置训练数据、超参数和实例类型等微调参数，然后提交定制作业。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a86b3c4dbb133a46",
      "translationZh": "或者，选择“Deploy on SageMaker AI”会在 Studio 中打开端点部署页面，其中模型已预先配置好。选择实例类型（同时可查看配额），检查设置，然后部署。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b7fe2aa7d6f6c48e",
      "translationZh": "步骤 4：测试端点",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "55532478d244fa93",
      "translationZh": "部署端点后，直接通过 Studio 的端点测试界面测试推理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "831d0f72d242b7d1",
      "translationZh": "开始使用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e61b5f450b81e0c6",
      "translationZh": "您今天就可以尝试这一体验：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3e2111f9a6096cf9",
      "translationZh": "在 Hugging Face 上浏览模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "86dbc471da63d22d",
      "translationZh": "在受支持的模型上查找“Customize on SageMaker AI”或“Deploy on SageMaker AI”按钮。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e35784e63d7bd058",
      "translationZh": "选择相应按钮，并按照简化的登录流程操作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "25142a7aa8f15d93",
      "translationZh": "在配置完备的 SageMaker Studio 环境中开始构建。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "89db2ad881f29c18",
      "translationZh": "结语",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1c265ada139c3536",
      "translationZh": "一键直达 Studio 体验的推出，最大限度地减少了从发现模型到动手试验之间的阻力。通过将 Hugging Face 直接连接到 SageMaker Studio 工作流，开发者可以保持流畅的工作状态。无需切换上下文，无需手动设置环境，也无需排查权限问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5aea2ad7e1840c8c",
      "translationZh": "要开始使用，请访问 Amazon SageMaker Studio 页面，或在 Hugging Face 上探索模型，并选择 Deploy 或 Customize on SageMaker AI。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
